<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#24103a;">Reset your password</h2>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>. This link expires in 15 minutes.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;"><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token), style: "display:inline-block;background:#24103a;color:#fff;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;" %></p>
<p style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px;">Didn't ask for this? Ignore this email — your password won't change.</p>
